      "name": "Original source-over fixtures \u2014 MIT",
      "description": "Original 16-bit background, transparent overlay, associated image, alpha map, generator and project under the repository MIT license. Three branches compare straight, premultiplied and separate-map representations against an independent exact-rational reference. Premultiplied PNG is an intentional processing fixture; its block explicitly declares that association. The standard output is straight BGRA. Checkerboard previews show real transparency. W3C source-over equations: https://www.w3.org/TR/compositing-1/#porterduffcompositingoperators",
